+- **Profile path gotcha**: In a profile session, `$HERMES_HOME` points to
+  `~/.hermes/profiles/<profile-name>/`, NOT `~/.hermes/`. The TUI scans
+  `$HERMES_HOME/tui-widgets/`, so widget files must go in
+  `~/.hermes/profiles/<profile-name>/tui-widgets/<name>.mjs`. Putting them
+  in `~/.hermes/tui-widgets/` will silently fail with "no user widgets
+  found". Verify the running TUI's `HERMES_HOME` with
+  `ps eww -p <TUI_PID> | tr ' ' '\n' | grep HERMES_HOME` if unsure.
 
